*(Repost to the public discuss list of a note originally sent to the
keyholders list on 2026-08-06; lightly redacted for the public archive.
Draft-filing PDF attachments from the original are not included.)*

Hi all,

Find below and attached some minimal drafts intended for markup and ripping
apart ahead of ideally a visit to this Friday for some SMLLC filings in
person I am doing in Augusta. Keen to hear y'alls feedback or find some time
to chitchat at teashop or over some nummies. Sorry for any radio silence, I
been pretty heckin low energy with all these crazy trips to MA.

Comment or suggest directly in the Docs / email / snail mail / real human
dialog in person™

If you want direct GitHub access to the repository or join as a github
administrator, reply and ask. Org: https://github.com/Great-Falls-Tool-Bus

The other repos are public, but I've created a probate meta repository
serving as the single source of truth for document revisions. The site prose
is out of date / still in its lorem ipsum phase, still gated for keyholders.
I love email.

The hyperkitty mail list (the keyholders list) is also gated. I think it'd
be awesome to get the mail, web and infra services running on solar
electrical service at the bus itself.

Excited to also share donor / bus initiative notes soonish too.

The four drafts (links were to private working docs; ask on-list for
access):

1. Membership and money
2. Power and hardware
3. Plot lease, draft agreement
4. Great Falls Tool Bus, LLC formation basics

Cheers,
Jess
